            "answer": "<p>Ultimate Snooze is built around a cleaner sleep philosophy: natural latex, organic cotton, and organic wool, with no fiberglass, no polyurethane foam comfort layers, no synthetic flame retardants, and no chemical adhesives in the mattress build. Each mattress is handcrafted in the USA and designed in collaboration with Gary Brecka.</p>"
