          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "About Organic Snooze",
            "question": "Who designed the Ultimate Snooze mattress?",
            "answer": "<p>The mattress was co-created by Gary Brecka, Matt Smith, and Ajay Nwosu to bring together sleep industry experience, wellness-focused product design, and organic material standards.</p>"
          }
        },
