          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Mattress Materials",
            "question": "What is natural latex?",
            "answer": "<p>Natural latex is a responsive mattress material made from rubber tree sap. It contours to the body without the slow-sinking feel of memory foam and is known for durability, breathability, and support.</p>"
          }
        },
