          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Mattress Materials",
            "question": "What does organic wool do in a mattress?",
            "answer": "<p>Organic wool helps create a natural fire barrier while also supporting temperature regulation and moisture management. It is one of the key reasons the mattress can be made without fiberglass or chemical flame-retardant sprays.</p>"
