          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Mattress Materials",
            "question": "What does organic cotton do in a mattress?",
            "answer": "<p>Organic cotton creates a soft, breathable surface layer that sits closest to your body and supports a cleaner, more natural sleep environment.</p>"
