            "question": "What firmness mattress is best for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Side sleepers usually need more pressure relief, back sleepers often need a balance of contouring and support, and stomach sleepers usually need a firmer surface. If you want plush pressure relief, consider the Recovery Pillowtop. If you want firmer support, consider the Pure.</p>"
