            "question": "Is Ultimate Snooze good for back pain?",
            "answer": "<p>A supportive mattress can help reduce discomfort caused by poor sleep posture or an unsupportive mattress. Ultimate Snooze uses responsive latex and supportive coils to help promote alignment, but chronic or severe pain should be discussed with a healthcare professional.</p>"
